{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medic Mayhem is a fast-paced action game where you are a medic and rescue wounded soldiers! Speed through the chaotic toy battlegrounds to pick up fallen troops and deliver them to your hospital. Once healed, soldiers rejoin the fight on your side. Destroy the enemy base and victory is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 1:</strong> Collect wounded soldiers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/fdff03c201461673f6ea8ea3791b36e7.poster.avif?t=1773381346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/fdff03c201461673f6ea8ea3791b36e7.webm?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/fdff03c201461673f6ea8ea3791b36e7.mp4?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 2:</strong> Deliver soldiers to your hospital</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/4c994483e04a9afcfd85059de1f92cdb.poster.avif?t=1773381346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/4c994483e04a9afcfd85059de1f92cdb.webm?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/4c994483e04a9afcfd85059de1f92cdb.mp4?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 3:</strong> Win the war!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/f12b6091c73fe1794434cb5fc0650fc8.poster.avif?t=1773381346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/f12b6091c73fe1794434cb5fc0650fc8.webm?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/f12b6091c73fe1794434cb5fc0650fc8.mp4?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense gameplay:</strong> Race to the front line, outmaneuver your opponents and rescue more soldiers than the enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun For All:</strong> Four player local competitive multiplayer with friends and bots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambulance upgrades:</strong> Collect powerups like the troop magnet or dynamite to gain an edge in the fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic levels:</strong> Battle in the playroom, literal sandbox, or bubbly bathroom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Language Barrier:</strong> No in-game text ensures you can enjoy playing no matter what your language is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throttle into Medic Mayhem and prove your skills on the chaotic toy battlefield. Can you win the war by saving lives?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543300?t=1773381346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543300?t=1773381346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/b906c2b19c9c5cb98a2f8871f8ab7ea8b86c3c32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773381346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/b906c2b19c9c5cb98a2f8871f8ab7ea8b86c3c32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773381346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4170150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medic Mayhem is a fast-paced action game where you are a medic and rescue wounded soldiers! Speed through the chaotic toy battlegrounds to pick up fallen troops and deliver them to your hospital. Once healed, soldiers rejoin the fight on your side. Destroy the enemy base and victory is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 1:</strong> Collect wounded soldiers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/fdff03c201461673f6ea8ea3791b36e7.poster.avif?t=1773381346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/fdff03c201461673f6ea8ea3791b36e7.webm?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543300/extras/fdff03c201461673f6ea8ea3791b36e7.mp4?t=1773381346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step 2:</strong> Deliver soldiers to your hospital</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu